// TCP connections through the host. A connection is read and written like
// a file, with io.read and io.write.

// Opens a connection to a host and port.
fn connect(host []u8, port u32) u32
// Listens for connections on the host's own address.
fn listen(port u32) u32
// Waits for the next connection to a listening handle.
fn accept(listener u32) u32
